[I] Google Noto Serif CJK fonts

[T] Noto Serif CJK is a serif font family from the Google Noto project
[T] covering Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese and Korean.
[T] It was developed together with Adobe, which releases the same fonts as
[T] Source Han Serif.

[U] https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk

[A] Google Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/font
[F] CROSS

[L] OFL
[V] 2.003

[D] d137e17b2a24dbb8c7627074817950e0ae7bcaffa0eb1f860efd9160 noto-cjk-fonts-2.003.zip !https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk/releases/download/Serif2.003/02_NotoSerifCJK-OTF-VF.zip

runmake=0
var_append zipopt ' ' -d$pkg-$ver

hook_add postmake 5 'cp -fv */OTC/*.ttc $root$datadir/fonts/'
